								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Know whets really funny? Fan fair or whatever that waste of time is named. Now that&#039;s funny. What is even more funny is the folks that you meet there. They look nothing like the signatures they got when they post shit to a fucking game. Get a life. You fast typing GEEKS with the wise ass shit have four eyes and look nothing like the your signatures you post . The ladies go for the sexy picture.  In RL they look nothing like the picture they portray. The boys ( men?) use signatures that look like some role model guy for GQ. You know who you are. You look nothing like what you want everyone to think you look like. Its a fucking game, get a fucking life. Your a  g -e -e -k.  Now don&#039;t forget to type some cool shit  come back with your cool picture of what you wished you looked like. Assholes.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
